#: ../../modules/utils/utils_interoperability.rst:2
msgid "Interoperability"
msgstr "Interoperabilitat"

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_interoperability.rst:4
msgid ""
"QiliSDK is rarely the only tool in a workflow, so :mod:`qilisdk.utils` "
"provides converters between QiliSDK objects and the formats used by other "
"quantum frameworks. Each converter comes as a pair of ``from_*`` and "
"``to_*`` functions, and each one depends on a third-party library that is "
"shipped as an optional extra."
msgstr ""
"QiliSDK poques vegades és l'única eina d'un flux de treball, així que "
":mod:`qilisdk.utils` proporciona convertidors entre els objectes de QiliSDK "
"i els formats que utilitzen altres marcs de treball quàntics. Cada "
"convertidor ve com una parella de funcions ``from_*`` i ``to_*``, i cadascun"
" depèn d'una biblioteca de tercers que es distribueix com un extra opcional."

