#: ../../modules/utils/utils_interoperability.rst:107
msgid ""
"Each term of the ``QubitOperator`` becomes a product of "
":class:`~qilisdk.analog.hamiltonian.PauliX`, "
":class:`~qilisdk.analog.hamiltonian.PauliY` and "
":class:`~qilisdk.analog.hamiltonian.PauliZ` operators on the corresponding "
"qubits. OpenFermion's empty term, which stands for the identity, becomes "
":class:`~qilisdk.analog.hamiltonian.PauliI` on qubit 0."
msgstr ""
"Cada terme del ``QubitOperator`` es converteix en un producte d'operadors "
":class:`~qilisdk.analog.hamiltonian.PauliX`, "
":class:`~qilisdk.analog.hamiltonian.PauliY` i "
":class:`~qilisdk.analog.hamiltonian.PauliZ` sobre els qubits corresponents. "
"El terme buit d'OpenFermion, que representa la identitat, es converteix en "
":class:`~qilisdk.analog.hamiltonian.PauliI` sobre el qubit 0."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_interoperability.rst:122
#: ../../modules/utils/utils_interoperability.rst:137
msgid "**Output**::"
msgstr "**Sortida**::"

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_interoperability.rst:126
msgid ""
"The reverse direction drops identity factors, since OpenFermion writes the "
"identity as the empty term, and stores every coefficient as a complex "
"number."
msgstr ""
"La direcció inversa descarta els factors identitat, ja que OpenFermion "
"escriu la identitat com el terme buit, i desa tots els coeficients com a "
"nombres complexos."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_interoperability.rst:144
msgid ""
"Only the qubit-operator representation is converted. An OpenFermion "
"``FermionOperator`` has to be mapped to qubits first (with "
"``jordan_wigner``, ``bravyi_kitaev`` or any other OpenFermion transform) "
"before it can be handed to "
":func:`~qilisdk.utils.openfermion.openfermion.openfermion_to_qilisdk`."
msgstr ""
"Només es converteix la representació com a operador de qubits. Un "
"``FermionOperator`` d'OpenFermion s'ha de mapar primer a qubits (amb "
"``jordan_wigner``, ``bravyi_kitaev`` o qualsevol altra transformació "
"d'OpenFermion) abans de poder passar-lo a "
":func:`~qilisdk.utils.openfermion.openfermion.openfermion_to_qilisdk`."
